        }
      },
      "why": "邊界值：17 位才合法。只測「空字串」抓不到這種。",
      "target": {
        "type": "none",
        "id": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "非法 id — 21 位（上界外）",
      "settings": {
        "mentionType": "user",
        "userId": "123456789012345678901",
        "mentionId": ""
      },
      "expect": {
        "content": "",
        "allowed_mentions": {
          "parse": []
        }
      },
      "why": "同上，另一邊界。",
      "target": {
        "type": "none",
        "id": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "拼錯的 mentionType",
      "settings": {
        "mentionType": "admin",
        "userId": "123456789012345678",
        "mentionId": ""
      },
      "expect": {
        "content": "",
        "allowed_mentions": {
          "parse": []
        }
      },
      "why": "不得 throw——SDK 在啟動路徑 throw 會炸掉整個工具；也不得退回 userId（那會讓打錯字變成靜默的 @自己）。",
      "target": {
        "type": "none",
        "id": ""
      }
    }
  ]
